Z||000000||overlord||07-02-99||10:48 AM||||grrr....<p>past couple weeks my 2.5 engine started spewwing up oil into the air cleaner....replaced the pvc things...still was happening...took it into the shop and got a compression test...WOAH!<br>3 cylinders were only 50 psi.<br>and then the other day it gave up totally.<br>I guess the engine was just worn out.(and i thought it was rujnning great??)<br>anywyas i got another eninge now and cant wait to get behind the drivers wheel.<p>I only wish i had the money to throw in a v6.<p>o well, jusst wanted to let u guys  know that there is no way in hell  im  giving up on this little car..(even thouhg the mechanics were telling me to....bastards...)
